==Trivia==
*This card's {{TCGP|immersive card|immersive}} illustration includes {{p|Meowth}}, {{p|Vivillon}}, {{p|Falinks}}, {{p|Chandelure}}, {{p|Mudkip}}, {{p|Cacnea}}, {{p|Ledyba}}, {{p|Delibird}}, {{p|Raboot}}, {{p|Smeargle}}, {{p|Drilbur}}, {{p|Maushold}}, {{p|Plusle}}, {{p|Minun}}, and {{p|Meloetta}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Nintendo Promo|Meowth|13}}, one of the {{TCG|Nintendo Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Feelin' Fine''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Roaring Skies|Meowth|67}} from the {{TCG|Roaring Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

